OL,3,GNEWSAFilm aims to show 'Christmas isn't
OL,4,Aall tinsel and gingerbread'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"If this was an American film, they
OL,7,Fwould have spent millions building a
OL,8,Fset," says actor John Bradley, "we've
OL,9,Fjust got it on our doorstep."
OL,11,FSpeaking at a gala screening of new
OL,12,Ffestive flick Merry Christmas Aubrey
OL,13,FFlint, the Game of Thrones star spoke
OL,14,Fglowingly about York's "warm, timeless
OL,15,Fand cinematic" charm.
OL,17,FSet in the city, the film opens with a
OL,18,Fsnowy shot of York Minster, with the
OL,19,Fhistoric cobbled streets and famous
OL,20,Ffestive markets also prominently
OL,21,Ffeatured.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
