OL,3,GNEWSAFilm aims to show 'Christmas isn't
OL,4,Aall tinsel and gingerbread'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile for some York may be the real
OL,7,Fstar of the show, the cast isn't short
OL,8,Fof a few stars itself, with director
OL,9,FJack Spring describing it as packed
OL,10,Fwith "British legend after British
OL,11,Flegend".
